vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:3000
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # Submit ASH Program Feedback
  
  Submits a combined student-and-parent feedback form for the ASH after-school programme. The form collects the student's self-reported experience alongside the parent/guardian's observations of the child's progress.
  
  On success, the feedback record is stored in the database. The endpoint returns the newly created feedback object with a `201 Created` status.
  
  ## Authorization
  No authentication is required for this endpoint (public form submission).
  
  ## Request Body (`application/json`)
  
  ### Student Section
  
  | Field                          | Type    | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values                                                                                               |
  |--------------------------------|---------|----------|----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | studentFirstName               | string  | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                                                             |
  | studentSurname                 | string  | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                                                             |
  | schoolName                     | string  | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                                                             |
  | currentClass                   | string  | Yes      | One of: `PRIMARY 3`, `PRIMARY 4`, `PRIMARY 5`, `PRIMARY 6`, `JSS1`, `JSS2`, `JSS3`, `SS1`, `SS2`, `SS3`                  |
  | attendanceFrequency            | string  | Yes      | One of: `EVERY WEEK`, `MOST WEEKS`, `SOMETIMES`, `RARELY`                                                                 |
  | enjoyedParts                   | array   | No       | Array of: `ACADEMIC TUTORING`, `LITERACY`, `NUMERACY`, `PERFORMANCE ARTS`, `SKILLS TRAINING`, `MENTORSHIP`, `GROUP ACTIVITIES` |
  | learningImprovementRating      | number  | Yes      | Integer from `1` to `5`                                                                                                    |
  | confidenceRating               | number  | Yes      | Integer from `1` to `5`                                                                                                    |
  | volunteerSupportRating         | number  | Yes      | Integer from `1` to `5`                                                                                                    |
  | studentEnjoyedMost             | string  | No       | Optional free text                                                                                                         |
  | studentImprovementSuggestions  | string  | No       | Optional free text                                                                                                         |
  
  ### Parent / Guardian Section
  
  | Field                        | Type    | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values                                                                                                    |
  |------------------------------|---------|----------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | parentGuardianName           | string  | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                                                                  |
  | parentGuardianRelationship   | string  | Yes      | One of: `FATHER`, `MOTHER`, `GUARDIAN`, `RELATIVE`                                                                             |
  | parentPhone                  | string  | No       | Optional phone number                                                                                                           |
  | childBenefited               | string  | Yes      | One of: `YES - GREATLY`, `YES - SOMEWHAT`, `NOT SURE`, `NO`                                                                    |
  | academicImprovementNoticed   | string  | No       | One of: `YES - SIGNIFICANT`, `YES - SOME`, `NO NOTICEABLE CHANGE`, `NOT SURE` (optional)                                       |
  | confidenceBehaviorChange     | string  | No       | One of: `YES - VERY POSITIVE`, `SOME IMPROVEMENT`, `NO CHANGE`, `NOT SURE` (optional)                                          |
  | mostValuableAspects          | array   | No       | Array of: `ACADEMIC TUTORING`, `LITERACY & NUMERACY`, `MENTORSHIP`, `SKILLS TRAINING`, `PERFORMANCE ARTS`, `POSITIVE ENVIRONMENT` |
  | parentSatisfactionRating     | number  | No       | Integer from `1` to `5` (optional)                                                                                              |
  | programImpactOnChild         | string  | No       | Optional free text                                                                                                              |
  | parentImprovementSuggestions | string  | No       | Optional free text                                                                                                              |
  | additionalComments           | string  | No       | Optional free text                                                                                                              |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`201 Created`** — Returns the newly created ASH feedback record.
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status                      | Description                                                           |
  |-----------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Validation failed — missing required fields or invalid enum values.   |
  | `404 Not Found`             | No registered ASH student matches the provided `studentSurname`.      |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error.                                              |
}
